# System Architecture

## Overview

Sarasvati Signals is composed of four major subsystems:

1. Data Collection Layer
2. Propagation Intelligence Layer
3. Visualization Layer
4. Timelapse Generation Layer

## Data Collection Layer

NOAA SWPC
NASA SDO
SOHO LASCO

## Propagation Intelligence Layer

Solar Flux Processing
Greyline Engine
MUF Engine
Absorption Engine
Ground Effects Engine
Auroral Engine

## Visualization Layer

index.html
global.html
propagation.html
path.html
muf_map.html
space_weather.html

## Timelapse Layer

timelapse_service.py

## Data Flow

Solar Data
↓
Model Processing
↓
HF Metrics
↓
REST API
↓
Dashboard